return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-26T12:05:05+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-26T12:05:05+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'Ìtúsílẹ̀ ìpìlẹ̀ Page Builder Sandwich tí a tún kọ: ètò àti ojú ìwé nípa, ìpele ìmújáde iwájú tí kò ní àpẹẹrẹ footprint, àti àpẹẹrẹ ìdènà àkó>kọ kan.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Awọn olupese AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Awọn oluṣe ChatGPT. Oluranlọwọ gbogbo-ni-gbogbo ti o dara.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Àwọn tó dá Claude. Wọ́n lágbára nínú kikọ̀ àti ìtumọ̀ fínnífínní.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Awọn awoṣe Gemini ti Google. Yara ati olowo poku.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Ilé-iṣẹ́ AI kan ní Yúróòpù pẹlu àwọn àwòṣe kíákíá, tí kò sì wọnú.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Awọn àwòṣe olowo poku ti o dara ni kikọ ati koodu.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Bọtín kan soso fun awọn awoṣe lati ọpọlọpọ awọn olupese oriṣiriṣi.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Èyíkéyìí iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí API OpenAI, títí kan àwṣ awoṣe tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí kọmpútà tàbí sẹ́fà rẹ̀.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Igbatọ̀gán (a máa ń lò wọ́n nígbà tì nǹkan pọ̀tọ́ mìíràn kò bá sí)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kikọ àti títúnkọ','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Code and CSS'=>'Koodu ati CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Má bínú, a kò yọ̀ǹda fún ọ láti wọ ojú ewé yìí.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Gbogbo àwọn plugin tó ń lo àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí ni wọ́n pin ín: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Awon key re ti wa ni sikiro (encrypted) ninu ibi ipamọ data aaye yii ati pe a nikan n ran won si olupese ti o yan — rara si wa.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ 1 nínú 2: yan olùpèsè AI kan','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'O mu kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ wá, nítorí náà o san owó fún Olùpèsè náà tààrà fún ohun tí o lò. O ò ní òmìnira láti mọ̀ dájú? Èyíkéyìí nínú wọ̀nyí ṣiṣẹ́ dáradára; o lè fi kún un nígbà tọ́ bá yẹ.','Next'=>'Níbẹ̀','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ 2 nínú 2: so %s pọ̀','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ OpenAI-compatible rẹ sii, ti o pari pẹlu /v1. A nilo bọtini kan nikan ti iṣẹ naa ba beere fun.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Ṣí %s kí o sì wọlé (tàbí kí o ṣẹ̀dá àkọọ̀lẹ̀ ọ̀fẹ́ kan).','the %s API keys page'=>'ojú-ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ṣẹda bọtọ titun kan ki o si daakọ rẹ̀.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Ẹ lẹ mọ́lẹ̀ sí ìsàlẹ̀ kí ẹ sì tẹ "Save and test". A máa ń rán ìbéèrè kékeré kan lọ láti ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Ọpọlọpọ awọn olupese nilo iye kekere lori akọọlẹ ṣaaju ki bọtini kan to le ṣiṣẹ: %s.','add credit'=>'fi kun kirẹditi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Yan olupese miiran','Address'=>'Àdíréèsi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Bọtọni kọ́kọ́rọ́ tí a fipamọ́ parẹ́ pẹlu …%s — lẹ́ mọ́ tẹ́lẹ̀ láti rọ́pò rẹ̀','Key (optional)'=>'Bọtínì (aṣayan)','API key'=>'Bọtìnì API','Save and test'=>'Fipamọ ki o si danwo','Providers'=>'Awọn olupese','Provider'=>'Olupese','Status'=>'Ipò','Key'=>'Bọtìnnì Ìkọkọ','Get a key'=>'Gba kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan','Test'=>'Idanwo','Remove'=>'Yọkùn','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'A fi ẹ̀yà àfikọ́ṣe tuntun pamọ́: ṣe àfikún àfikọ́ṣe yìí, tàbí tẹ kọ́ọ̀sì náà sílẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'A kò lè ṣí kọ́ọ̀sì tí a fipamọ́ mọ́ (àwọn kọ́ọ̀sì ààbò ojú-wẹ̀bù náà yípadà). Tun tẹ ẹ síwájú.','Not connected'=>'Kò sopọ̀','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Tẹ ẹ̀ — àdánwò tó kẹ́yìn yọrí sí rere %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Idanwo ti o kẹhin kuna: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Asopọ — a ko tii dan wo','Which model to use'=>'Irú àwọn àpẹẹrẹ wo ló yẹ kí a lò','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ ṣe àmì ìṣedúró wa fún iṣẹ́ yẹn. Àtòjọ náà ní gbogbo àwọn àwoṣe tí bọ́tìnnì rẹ lè lò, tí a kà ní tààrà Mọ́tò láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè náà.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— A ń gbani nímọ̀ràn fún olùpèsè —','Save models'=>'Fipamọ awọn awoṣe','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sọ àwọn àkọ́ṣe àwọn olùpèsè di tuntun','best quality'=>'didẹ ti o dara julọ','lowest cost'=>'iye ti o kere julọ','fastest'=>'tête ju','Add a model yourself'=>'Fi àwoṣan kun fúnra rẹ','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Ṣé àwẹ àwòṣe tuntun jáde lónìí? Fi orúkọ rẹ̀ gan-an sílẹ̀ láti lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Model name'=>'Orúkọ àwòṣe','Add model'=>'Fi awoṣe kun','Recommended models list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn àwòṣe tí a gbà níyànjú','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'A kò le fìdí àkójọ àwọn àwòṣe tí a ṣeduro rẹ̀ múlẹ̀, nítorí náà a kò fi àwọn ìṣeduro hàn. Tun gbe pugin sori, tabi tan imudojuiwọn ojoojumọ ni isalẹ.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Àtòjọ tí a ń lò ni a tẹ̀ jáde ní %s. Ìtẹ̀jáde àfikún kọ̀ọ̀kan mú tuntun wá.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Ẹ tún ṣàyẹ̀wò Zinn Digital® lẹ́ẹ̀kan lọ́jọ́ kan fún àkójọ tí a sọ di tuntun.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìṣàwọ̀lẹ̀ tí ó rọrùn nìkan ni a ń ránṣẹ́: kò sí kọ́kọ́rọ́, kò sí àdírẹ́sì sítì, kò sí ohunkohun nípa àkóónú rẹ̀. A fi ọwọ́ sí àkójọ náà, a sì máa ń fojú fo àkójọ tí kò bá kọjá àyẹ̀wò ọwọ́ ìfọwọ́sí.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Àyẹ̀wò kẹ́yìn %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Fi pamọ, ki o si ṣayẹwo ni bayi ti a ba tan-an','a newer list was installed'=>'a fi àtòjọ tuntun kan sori rẹ̀','already up to date'=>'ti ni imudojuiwọn tẹlẹ','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'igbaniwọle naa kuna idanwo ibuwọlu ati pe a foju si i','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital®; àkójọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yoo wa ni lílò','turned off'=>'ti a pa','Open'=>'Ṣí','Check their status page'=>'Ṣayẹ̀wọ́ ojú-ewé ipò wọn','Open your billing page'=>'Ṣí ojúewé ìwé-owó rẹ','Open your API keys page'=>'Ṣí ojú ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ','Open the AI settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Má bínú, a kò gbàyín láàyè láti ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Unknown provider.'=>'Olupese ti a ko mọ.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ rẹ sii, fun apẹẹrẹ http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Ìyẹn kò jọ bẹ́ẹ̀ kí ó jẹ́ kọ́kọ́rọ́ API. Ṣàkọwọ́ rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, láìsí àlàfo kankan.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ lẹ́ẹ̀ bọ̀ bọtìlì API rẹ.','Key removed.'=>'Ti yọ bọtínì kúrò.','Models saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn awoṣe naa.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Tẹ orúkọ gangan àwòṣe náà sílẹ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ bí ìwé àfikún olùpèsè ṣe kọ ọ́.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'A ti fi %s kun. Yan ni abẹ́ "Àwoṣe wo lo yẹ ki a lo".','Model removed.'=>'A ti yọ awoṣe kuro.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Àwọn ìgbékalẹ̀ ojúmọ́ ti wà ní pípa. A ń lò àkójọ tí ó wá pẹ̀lú plọ́gìnnì náà.','Checked: %s.'=>'A ti ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'A sọ àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ àpẹẹrẹ di tuntun.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ẹya tuntun ti ọkan ninu awọn afikun rẹ lo fipamọ bọtini AI rẹ. Ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tẹ bọtini naa sii lẹẹkan si ninu awọn eto AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'A kò lè tú bọ́tìnnì AI tí o ti fi pamọ́ sílẹ̀ mọ́ (àwọn bọ́tìnnì ààbò ojú-wẹ̀bù náà ti yí padà). Tún tẹ́ ẹ sí abala ètò AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'A ko ti seto AI. Fi bọtini kan kun fun olupese AI ninu awọn eto AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Kò sí àpẹẹrẹ kan tí a yàn fún iṣẹ́ yìí. Yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ètò AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Ẹ̀rọ ìmọ̀ ẹ̀rọ àwọn olùpèsè AI yẹn kò ní àtìlẹyìn látọ̀dọ̀ ẹ̀dà yìí ti plọ́gìnnì náà.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Aaye yii ko le de ọdọ iṣẹ AI rẹ. Ṣayẹwo pe o nṣiṣẹ ati pe adirẹsi rẹ wa lati ọdọ olupin wẹẹbu rẹ (iṣẹ kan lori kọmputa rẹ ko le de ọdọ lati aaye ti o gbalejo).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Ko le de ọdọ %s. Ṣayẹwo ojú-ewé ipò wọn; bí wọ́n bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́, ó ṣeé ṣe pé ilé-iṣẹ́ tí ó ń gbalejo rẹ ń dènà àwọn ìsopọ̀ tí ń jáde, tàbí pé àdírẹ́sì náà jẹ́ àṣìṣe.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s sọ pé àkáǹtì rẹ kò ní kírédìtì tàbí kótà kankan mọ́. Fi kírédìtì kún un tàbí gbé ìwọ̀n rẹ ga nínú àkáǹtì rẹ pẹ̀lú wọn, lẹ́yìn náà tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kọ́ kọ́ọ̀ṣì rẹ. Ó lè jẹ́ pé a tẹ̀ ẹ́ jọ̀̀, a ti fagilé rẹ̀ tàbí ó ti pé ọjọ́. Ṣẹ̀dá kọ́ọ̀ṣì tuntun kan kí o sì lẹ̀ ẹ́ sí ibi.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kọ ìbéèrè yìí fún bọ́tìnnì rẹ. Ó ṣe é ṣe kí bọ́tìnnì náà kò ní ààyè sí àwṣ̀rẹ́tì tàbí ẹ̀yà ara yìí, tàbí kí ó jẹ́ pé a nílò láti fìdí àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ múlẹ̀.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Ko si awoṣe "%1$s" lati %2$s fun bọ́ọ̀ṣì rẹ. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Ètò %2$s rẹ ko ni awoṣe "%1$s" ninu. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI, tabi sọ eto rẹ di tuntun pẹlu wọn.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s nfi opin si bi o ṣe yara to ti bọtini rẹ le fi awọn ibeere ranṣẹ. Duro fun iṣẹju kan ki o tun gbiyanju si tun, tabi gbe opin oṣuwọn rẹ soke pẹlu wọn.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'Awọn iṣoro wa pẹlu %s ni akoko yii (boya isoro nẹtiwọọki tabi ẹru pọju lori apakan wọn). Ko si ohun ti ko tọ si pẹlu awọn eto rẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si laipẹ.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ìbéèrè AI náà kùnà fún ìdí kan tí a kò lè mọ̀. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá ń ṣẹlẹ̀ sí i, kan si àtìlẹ́yìn pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Olupese AI naa dahun ni ọna ti pḷọọgìì ni ko le ka. Tun gbiyanju siwaju sii; ti o ba n tẹsiwaju, yan awoṣe miiran tabi kan si atilẹyin.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Àṣàyàn (Tí ó ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Fi bọtínì kan pamọ́ fún olùpèsè yìí kọ́kọ́.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Bọtìní rẹ n ṣiṣẹ, ṣugbọn olupese naa ko ṣe at তালিকা awoṣe ọrọ kankan fun un. Fi awoṣe kun fun ara rẹ ni isalẹ.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ó ti sopọ̀. %1$s ti dáhùn nípa lílo %2$s. Awọn ẹ̀yà ara AI rẹ ti ṣetan lati lo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'A kò gba ipa olùṣe rẹ laaye lati lo AI lori aaye yii. Bi olùṣakoso kan lọwọ.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin inawo AI rẹ fun oṣu yii. Alabojuto le gbe e soke ni awọn eto AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin opin oṣooṣu rẹ ti awọn ibeere AI. Alabojuto kan le gbe e soke ni awọn eto AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Lilo ati iye owo','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀, àwọn ààlà, àti àwọn àṣẹ ipa wúlò fún AI tí a lò nípasẹ̀: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Awọn iye owo jẹ isunmọ, ti a ṣe iṣiro lati awọn owo ti a tẹjade; awoṣe kan laisi owo ti a mọ ni a ka bi odo.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Oṣù yìí: %1$s àwọn ìbéèrè, nǹkan bí %2$s.','When'=>'Nigbati','Who'=>'Ta ni','Used for'=>'Fun lo','Model'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ','Tokens in / out'=>'Àwọn àmì tó wọlé / tó jáde','About'=>'Nipa','Result'=>'Èsì','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí ìbéèrè AI kankan tí a ti ṣe.','Done'=>'Gbà á sílẹ̀','Limits and permissions'=>'Àwọn ẹnìkan àti àwọn àṣẹ','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iwọn inawo oṣooṣu (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Fi sílẹ láìsí níní òpin. AI máa ń dúró fún ìyókù oṣù náà ní kété tí iye owó tí a fẹ́rẹ̀ẹ́ ná dé ibẹ̀.','Monthly request limit'=>'Ìwọ̀n àìbéèrè lóṣooṣù','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Fi o sipo asan fun ailopin.','Who may use AI'=>'Tani o le lo AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Má sàmì kankan láti jẹ́ kí olúkúlùkù tó lè lo àwọn ẹ̀yà ara plugin náà lo AI. Àwọn aláṣẹ lè lò ó nígbà gbogbo.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Fipamọ awọn opin ati awọn àṣẹ','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Awon iwọn ati awon aṣẹ ti fipamọ.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Awọn iwe afọwọkọ ti iboju abojuto sonu ninu ẹ̀dà yìí ti fọọmu (plugin). Tun fi sii lati inu àpò ti a tu silẹ.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ojú-ìwé yìí nílò JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Àwọn èdè','Upgrade'=>'Ṣe igbega si ipele giga','Pricing'=>'Iye owó','Start Trial'=>'Bẹrẹ Idanwo','Account'=>'Akawọ','Contact Us'=>'Kanṣoṣo Wa','Affiliation'=>'Ìbáṣepọ̀','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'Olùfẹnọ̀kan','greetingHey %s,'=>'Ẹ ǹlọ %s,','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, 